      "body": "声音每隔固定时间响一次。你看清风吹菌盖、孢子雾散开的规律，可以循着节奏安全穿越。\n\n获得知识「菌雾节奏」，解锁「金属声源」。本次遭遇结束。",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "continue",
          "label": {
            "default": "继续",
            "variants": [
              {
                "when": {
                  "mode": "all",
                  "clauses": [
                    {
                      "source": "flag",
                      "key": "dialogueBattleAction",
                      "operator": "eq",
                      "value": true
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "text": "面对粪怪"
              }
            ]
          },
          "action": "result_continue"
        }
      ],
      "kicker": "行动结果",
      "allowClose": false,
